WEBVTT

00:02:29.796 --> 00:02:30.876
the decision-makers --

00:02:30.876 --> 00:02:35.396
they have the unique opportunity of being
part of the most important challenge

00:02:35.396 --> 00:02:37.156
that we have ever faced as a species.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:38.836
LY Jr.: I hope you don’t lose hope;

00:02:38.836 --> 00:02:40.156
I pray you don’t lose hope.

00:02:40.156 --> 00:02:42.076
I’ve seen some of you want to check out.

00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:43.076
Don’t check out,

00:02:43.076 --> 00:02:44.076
don’t give up,

00:02:44.076 --> 00:02:45.076
don’t give in.

00:02:45.076 --> 00:02:46.076
Fight to the end.

00:02:46.076 --> 00:02:47.316
Whatever you do,

00:02:47.316 --> 00:02:48.996
keep fighting for this planet.

00:02:49.316 --> 00:02:50.316
[Countdown]